    {
      "text": "Stacked horizontal bar charts showing the percentage of studies judged high (red), unclear (yellow) or low (green) for each domain, with study counts on the bars. Risk of bias: patient selection 1 high, 1 unclear, 25 low; index test 27 low; reference standard 6 unclear, 21 low; flow and timing 1 unclear, 26 low. Applicability concerns: patient selection 3 high, 2 unclear, 22 low; index test 3 unclear, 24 low; reference standard 1 unclear, 26 low.",
